 985:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *               in voltage and temperature.
 986:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (**) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32f7xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
