 980:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 981:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Reverse byte order (16 bit)
 982:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Reverses the byte order within each halfword of a word. For example, 0x12345678 becomes 
 983:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    value  Value to reverse
 984:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \return               Reversed value
