 997:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Reverses the byte order in a 16-bit value and returns the signed 16-bit result. For exam
 998:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    value  Value to reverse
 999:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \return               Reversed value
1000:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****  */
