1016:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Rotate Right (immediate) provides the value of the contents of a register rotated by a v
1017:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    op1  Value to rotate
1018:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    op2  Number of Bits to rotate
